      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Currently, Tupper himself has mentioned that all loaded avatars remain in memory until you switch worlds.\"\nImportant to note this is because this is a limitation of Unity, not VRChat. Because who would've thought, Unity was not built to handle assets being downloaded and loaded into a scene a lot.\nIf you don't believe me then go look at what Tupper said recently in the link below.\nTuppers recent statement on this: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/memory-leaks",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
