      "value": "@{5f2cc9743e5e4b3102c1074e|full_name}: So make a workaround. Prevent new avatars loading once you're close to full memory. Literally any solution would be better than having to try and be aware of my RAM load and manually switching worlds lest I inevitably crash and have to take my headset off and reboot everything.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
